 The risk console reads requests from the `risk-approvals` queue and shows them to
 the risk officers on duty. An officer approves or declines; the console calls the
 owning service's decision handler with the request's task token.

 Requests that no officer has answered within five working days are archived by the
 console and are never answered after that.

+## Overdraft limit increases
+
+Increases of more than 500.00 above the current limit need an officer's approval.
+The `overdraft-increase` workflow sends them to the queue and waits for the decision;
+smaller increases are applied at once.
