+## Card limit increases
+
+Increases of more than 1,000.00 now go to an officer instead of being declined. The
+approval step waits at most fourteen days (`TimeoutSeconds` 1209600, longer than the
+five working days plus weekends and holidays); a request still unanswered then is declined, and the
+card's pending request is cleared like any other decline.
